{"id": "EUVD-2026-72357", "enisaUuid": "ae6fc2af-34d4-39eb-a664-1d46e199c75c", "description": "A flaw was found in FreeIPA's idp-add command, where insufficiently validated --organization/--base-url input reaches a constrained eval() call before the corresponding LDAP access control check is enforced. This allows any authenticated IPA principal, regardless of privilege level, to enumerate and read the environment variables of the affected server process and to cause denial of service via memory exhaustion.", "datePublished": "2026-09-07T12:02:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T05:08:13", "baseScore": 8.1, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:N/A:H", "references": ["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:70564", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:72279", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:82935", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83083", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83084", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83085", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83460", "https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:83461", "https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-79678", "https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2523356"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-79678", "GHSA-2rwh-2wx9-4qwh"], "assigner": "redhat", "epss": 0.89, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3bb59d22-a5e6-3424-90c1-72323842d381", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8100020261007071200.143e9e98"}, {"id": "494a787b-ae71-35db-9ca6-ec37571c2fb4", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.8 Update Services for SAP Solutions", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8080020261007071832.b0a6ceea"}, {"id": "5817a389-eafa-3be2-9dac-25c1061e32a5", "product": {"name": "Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8", "vendor": {"name": "Red Hat"}}, "product_version": "patch: 8100020261007070536.823393f5"}, {"id": "8bdc9147-f369-30cf-8548-97331db8a04